UPDATE personas SET instruction = replace(instruction, $old$A Muse account is a Meta login. harnessAccounts.quota reports signed_out for a profile without a login and unsupported for a signed-in profile, because Muse exposes its subscription windows only inside a running session. Treat unsupported Muse quota as unknown quota.$old$, $new$A Muse account is a Meta login. harnessAccounts.quota reports signed_out for a profile without a login. A Muse agent run saves the session and weekly windows of its login, so a profile with a recent run reports ok with those windows, and a profile without one reports unavailable. Treat unavailable Muse quota as unknown quota, and expect it to fill after the first Muse run.$new$), updated_at=now() WHERE kind='manager' AND instruction LIKE $like$%A Muse account is a Meta login. harnessAccounts.quota reports signed_out for a profile without a login and unsupported for a signed-in profile, because Muse exposes its subscription windows only inside a running session. Treat unsupported Muse quota as unknown quota.%$like$;
